@startuml
title Save Test Result Sequence (/api/quiz/sessions/{id}/answer and /finish)

autonumber
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center

actor Learner
boundary "Quiz Session UI" as QuizSessionUi
control "QuizSessionNotifier\n(FE Mobile)" as FeController
control "QuizApiService\n(FE Mobile)" as FeApiService
entity "QuizAnswerResultDto\n(FE Response DTO)" as FeAnswerDto
entity "QuizResultDto\n(FE Response DTO)" as FeResultDto
entity "SubmitAnswerRequest\n(BE Request DTO)" as BeSubmitAnswerDto
entity "AnswerResponse\n(BE Response DTO)" as BeAnswerDto
entity "QuizResultResponse\n(BE Response DTO)" as BeResultDto
control "QuizSessionsController\n(BE API)" as BeController
control "QuizSubmissionService" as SubmissionService
control "QuizResultService" as ResultService
control "QuizQuestionBuilder" as QuestionBuilder
control "SrsService" as SrsService
entity "TestSession" as TestSessionEntity
entity "TestAnswer" as TestAnswerEntity
entity "UserWordProgress" as UserWordProgressEntity
entity "Word" as WordEntity
entity "WordSense" as WordSenseEntity
control "QuizSubmissionRepository" as SubmissionRepository
control "QuizQuestionRepository" as QuestionRepository
control "SrsRepository" as SrsRepository
control "QuizResultRepository" as ResultRepository
database "VocaNovaDbContext" as DbContext
database "MySQL Database" as MySQL

note over QuizSessionUi, MySQL
Checked in current code:
Mobile UI file exists: quiz_session_screen.dart.
FE controller/service exist: QuizSessionNotifier and QuizApiService.
FE response DTOs exist: QuizAnswerResultDto and QuizResultDto.
BE request DTO exists: SubmitAnswerRequest.
BE response DTOs exist: AnswerResponse and QuizResultResponse.
Endpoints are POST /api/quiz/sessions/{id}/answer,
POST /api/quiz/sessions/{id}/finish and GET /api/quiz/sessions/{id}/result.
Entities exist: TestSession, TestAnswer, UserWordProgress, Word and WordSense.
end note

Learner -> QuizSessionUi: Submit answer
QuizSessionUi -> FeController: submitAnswer(answer)
FeController -> FeApiService: submitAnswer(sessionId, wordId,\nanswer, listId?)
FeApiService -> BeController: POST /api/quiz/sessions/{id}/answer\nSubmitAnswerRequest JSON
BeController -> BeSubmitAnswerDto: Bind request body
BeSubmitAnswerDto --> BeController: SubmitAnswerRequest
BeController -> BeController: Check authenticated user
BeController -> SubmissionService: SubmitAnswerAsync(userId, sessionId, command)
SubmissionService -> SubmissionRepository: GetStateAsync(userId, sessionId, wordId)
SubmissionRepository -> DbContext: Query session with answers/topics
DbContext -> MySQL: SELECT test_sessions,\ntest_answers, test_session_topics
MySQL --> DbContext: Session state rows
DbContext -> TestSessionEntity: Read TestSession
DbContext -> TestAnswerEntity: Read TestAnswer rows
TestSessionEntity --> DbContext: Session state
TestAnswerEntity --> DbContext: Existing answers
DbContext --> SubmissionRepository: Submission state or null
SubmissionRepository --> SubmissionService: Submission state or null

alt Session not found or not in progress
    SubmissionService --> BeController: NotFound or Conflict result
    BeController --> FeApiService: HTTP 404/409 error
    FeApiService --> FeController: Action failed
    FeController --> QuizSessionUi: Show submit error
else Session in progress
    SubmissionService -> QuestionBuilder: BuildQuestionAsync(wordId, questionType)
    QuestionBuilder -> QuestionRepository: FindQuestionWordAsync(wordId)
    QuestionRepository -> DbContext: Query Word with senses
    DbContext -> MySQL: SELECT words,\nword_senses
    MySQL --> DbContext: Question word rows
    DbContext -> WordEntity: Read Word
    DbContext -> WordSenseEntity: Read WordSense
    WordEntity --> DbContext: Word
    WordSenseEntity --> DbContext: Expected answer
    DbContext --> QuestionRepository: Question word
    QuestionRepository --> QuestionBuilder: Question data
    QuestionBuilder --> SubmissionService: Question
    SubmissionService -> SubmissionService: Grade answer
    SubmissionService -> SrsService: UpdateProgressAsync(userId, wordId, isCorrect)
    SrsService -> SrsRepository: FindAsync(userId, wordId)
    SrsRepository -> DbContext: Query UserWordProgress
    DbContext -> MySQL: SELECT user_word_progresses
    MySQL --> DbContext: Progress row or null
    DbContext -> UserWordProgressEntity: Read UserWordProgress?
    UserWordProgressEntity --> DbContext: UserWordProgress or null
    DbContext --> SrsRepository: Progress state
    SrsRepository --> SrsService: Progress state
    SrsService -> SrsRepository: Stage progress changes
    SrsRepository -> UserWordProgressEntity: Create or update progress
    UserWordProgressEntity --> SrsRepository: Progress staged

    alt Last question reached
        SubmissionService -> TestSessionEntity: Set status completed
        TestSessionEntity --> SubmissionService: Session completed
    else More questions remain
        SubmissionService -> QuestionBuilder: BuildNextQuestionAsync()
        QuestionBuilder --> SubmissionService: Next question
    end

    SubmissionService -> SubmissionRepository: SaveSubmissionAsync(changes)
    SubmissionRepository -> TestAnswerEntity: Create or update TestAnswer
    TestAnswerEntity --> SubmissionRepository: TestAnswer staged
    SubmissionRepository -> DbContext: Save answer, session\nand progress
    DbContext -> MySQL: INSERT/UPDATE test_answers,\nUPDATE test_sessions,\nINSERT/UPDATE user_word_progresses
    MySQL --> DbContext: Save result
    DbContext --> SubmissionRepository: Save result
    SubmissionRepository --> SubmissionService: Saved
    SubmissionService --> BeController: Answer result
    BeController -> BeAnswerDto: Create AnswerResponse
    BeAnswerDto --> BeController: AnswerResponse
    BeController --> FeApiService: HTTP 200 OK\nAnswerResponse
    FeApiService -> FeAnswerDto: Parse response data
    FeAnswerDto --> FeApiService: QuizAnswerResult
    FeApiService --> FeController: Answer result
    FeController --> QuizSessionUi: Show answer feedback\nor next question
end

opt Learner finishes early or time/lives end
    QuizSessionUi -> FeController: finish()
    FeController -> FeApiService: finishSession(sessionId)
    FeApiService -> BeController: POST /api/quiz/sessions/{id}/finish
    BeController -> ResultService: FinishSessionAsync(userId, sessionId)
    ResultService -> ResultRepository: GetSessionAsync(userId, sessionId)
    ResultRepository -> DbContext: Query TestSession
    DbContext -> MySQL: SELECT test_sessions
    MySQL --> DbContext: Session row or null
    DbContext -> TestSessionEntity: Read TestSession?
    TestSessionEntity --> DbContext: TestSession or null
    ResultService -> ResultService: Build finish changes
    ResultService -> ResultRepository: SaveFinishAsync(changes)
    ResultRepository -> TestSessionEntity: Set status abandoned\nand ended_at
    TestSessionEntity --> ResultRepository: TestSession updated
    ResultRepository -> DbContext: Save TestSession
    DbContext -> MySQL: UPDATE test_sessions
    MySQL --> DbContext: Save result
    ResultService --> BeController: Quiz result
    BeController -> BeResultDto: Create QuizResultResponse
    BeResultDto --> BeController: QuizResultResponse
    BeController --> FeApiService: HTTP 200 OK\nQuizResultResponse
end

opt Learner opens result screen
    QuizSessionUi -> FeApiService: getResult(sessionId)
    FeApiService -> BeController: GET /api/quiz/sessions/{id}/result
    BeController -> ResultService: GetResultAsync(userId, sessionId)
    ResultService -> ResultRepository: GetSessionAsync(userId, sessionId)
    ResultRepository -> DbContext: Query TestSession
    DbContext -> MySQL: SELECT test_sessions
    MySQL --> DbContext: Session row
    ResultService -> ResultRepository: GetAnswersAsync(sessionId)
    ResultRepository -> DbContext: Query TestAnswer rows
    DbContext -> MySQL: SELECT test_answers
    MySQL --> DbContext: Answer rows
    DbContext -> TestAnswerEntity: Read TestAnswer rows
    TestAnswerEntity --> DbContext: TestAnswer results
    ResultService --> BeController: Quiz result
    BeController -> BeResultDto: Create QuizResultResponse
    BeResultDto --> BeController: QuizResultResponse
    BeController --> FeApiService: HTTP 200 OK\nQuizResultResponse
    FeApiService -> FeResultDto: Parse response data
    FeResultDto --> FeApiService: QuizResult
    FeApiService --> QuizSessionUi: Show saved test result
end

@enduml
